    <string name="desktop_input_help">Capture the trackpad from More to hide the Android pointer and control the Mac across the whole display. On raw trackpads: one finger moves, two fingers scroll, one-finger tap clicks, two-finger tap right-clicks. Tap then touch and hold to drag. Three-finger swipes open Mission Control or switch Spaces.</string>
    <string name="desktop_capture_help">Press Ctrl+Alt+Backspace to release capture, or use the touchscreen sidebar → More → Release trackpad. Capture ends when you leave the app. Gesture availability depends on the keyboard cover and Android.</string>
