    <string name="sidebar_menu_bar_help">Selects your Mac’s menu bar using Control + F2. Use arrow keys and Return to navigate menus; the selection may appear on your Mac’s screen.\n\nIf nothing happens, check your Mac’s Keyboard Shortcuts for “Move focus to the menu bar” and allow OpenDisplay in Privacy &amp; Security → Accessibility.</string>
    <string name="sidebar_dock_help">Shows or hides your Mac’s Dock using Option + Command + D. The Dock may appear on the Mac’s screen rather than this display.\n\nIf nothing happens, check your Mac’s Keyboard Shortcuts for “Turn Dock hiding on/off” and allow OpenDisplay in Privacy &amp; Security → Accessibility.</string>
    <string name="sidebar_disconnect_help">Ends the current display session and returns to the main connection page. The Android app stays open.</string>
